                      (adybug/src/main.s):01531         
C8C8 7FFF21           (adybug/src/main.s):01532                 clr     PIA2_CRA        ; select PIA2 PA direction register
C8CB 86FC             (adybug/src/main.s):01533                 lda     #$FC
